(33926, 'TourPackage', 'TourPackage: add description service: <div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX : 20 PAX + 1 T/L + 1DRV</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ROOM RQ: 7TWN+1DBL+5DFS+1SGL</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	T/L:MR NIE WEI&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE:+86 15951818089</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER &nbsp;: <span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Mr Gangel Zsolt</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE : +421918922700, +36707790626</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	COACH DETAILS: &nbsp;49 + 2 seats, MAN, reg.plate: NZ222GZ&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** EETS arrange meal service for the group only 5 times during the tour. These meals for driver included.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;Rest of the meals T/L need to provide meal or give &nbsp;budget for driver</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**1 water pp included per day</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not &nbsp;exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive &nbsp;45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at &nbsp;the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of &nbsp;restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p> at HCG-SH', 1176, 'App\\TourPackage', 63, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"created\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/220\"}', '2023-06-26 12:12:16', '2023-06-26 12:12:16'),
(33927, 'TourPackage', 'change value of \'time_from\' from \'2023-04-30 12:00:00\' to \'2023-04-30 00:00\' at service: \'<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX : 20 PAX + 1 T/L + 1DRV</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ROOM RQ: 7TWN+1DBL+5DFS+1SGL</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	T/L:MR NIE WEI&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE:+86 15951818089</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER &nbsp;: <span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Mr Gangel Zsolt</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE : +421918922700, +36707790626</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	COACH DETAILS: &nbsp;49 + 2 seats, MAN, reg.plate: NZ222GZ&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** EETS arrange meal service for the group only 5 times during the tour. These meals for driver included.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;Rest of the meals T/L need to provide meal or give &nbsp;budget for driver</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**1 water pp included per day</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not &nbsp;exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive &nbsp;45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at &nbsp;the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of &nbsp;restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\', at Tour: \'HCG-SH\'', 1176, 'App\\TourPackage', 63, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"updated\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/220\"}', '2023-06-26 12:12:33', '2023-06-26 12:12:33');
