(33983, 'TourPackage', 'TourPackage: add description service: <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:650px;\" width=\"650\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n				<p>\r\n					<strong>PAX: 10 ADULTS+ 1 T/L + 1 DRV<br />\r\n					ROOM RQ: 1TWIN+4DBL+2SGL<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					T/L: MR DAVID&nbsp;<br />\r\n					MOBILE: +44 7428155758<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					DRIVER: Mr Szab󠍩kl󳼢r&gt;MOBILE: +36 20 389 2070<br />\r\n					COACH DETAILS: MAN, 49+2 seats, reg.plate: PZZ-099<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					MEALS: 3 courses for local meals, 6 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					SPECIAL MEAL RQ:&nbsp;<br />\r\n					one guest no pork and two guests no meat(only fish,egg,vegetables)<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					** Two bottle of water per person per day(include TL).T/L will pay on spot to driver<br />\r\n					** EETS provides meal budget for driver 9times, please do not ask it from T/L<br />\r\n					** Driver and local guide tips pay on spot by T/L<br />\r\n					** Porterage is not included<br />\r\n					** Highway fee included<br />\r\n					**CESKY KRUMLOV pick-up/drop-off place and terminal is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER<br />\r\n					1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:<br />\r\n					* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not exceed 9 hours.<br />\r\n					* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.<br />\r\n					* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.<br />\r\n					* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.<br />\r\n					These are at the clients own risk.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					3.In case you want to change a menu of restaurant please contact EETS at least<br />\r\n					2 days before in order to ensure your request.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least<br />\r\n					2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately<br />\r\n					restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .<br />\r\n					( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the<br />\r\n					seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp;<br />\r\n					responsible for possible penalty.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p> at WITA', 1198, 'App\\TourPackage', 63, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"created\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/223\"}', '2023-06-28 11:41:49', '2023-06-28 11:41:49'),
(33984, 'TourPackage', 'change value of \'time_from\' from \'2023-04-24 12:00:00\' to \'2023-04-24 00:30\' at service: \'<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:650px;\" width=\"650\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n				<p>\r\n					<strong>PAX: 10 ADULTS+ 1 T/L + 1 DRV<br />\r\n					ROOM RQ: 1TWIN+4DBL+2SGL<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					T/L: MR DAVID&nbsp;<br />\r\n					MOBILE: +44 7428155758<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					DRIVER: Mr Szab󠍩kl󳼢r&gt;MOBILE: +36 20 389 2070<br />\r\n					COACH DETAILS: MAN, 49+2 seats, reg.plate: PZZ-099<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					MEALS: 3 courses for local meals, 6 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					SPECIAL MEAL RQ:&nbsp;<br />\r\n					one guest no pork and two guests no meat(only fish,egg,vegetables)<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					** Two bottle of water per person per day(include TL).T/L will pay on spot to driver<br />\r\n					** EETS provides meal budget for driver 9times, please do not ask it from T/L<br />\r\n					** Driver and local guide tips pay on spot by T/L<br />\r\n					** Porterage is not included<br />\r\n					** Highway fee included<br />\r\n					**CESKY KRUMLOV pick-up/drop-off place and terminal is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot.<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					<br />\r\n					IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER<br />\r\n					1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:<br />\r\n					* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not exceed 9 hours.<br />\r\n					* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.<br />\r\n					* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.<br />\r\n					* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop