otel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!&nbsp;</div>\' to \'<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	PAX:&nbsp; 6 TWN + 2 DBL + 3 SGL</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	ROOM RQ: 17 PAX + 1 TL + 1 DRV</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	T/L:&nbsp; Mr LIN/SHENGHSIANG</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE:&nbsp; +886900635603</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DRIVER: Mr Iko Gabor</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE: <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>+36 70 617 2338</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DATE: 27 Aug VIE-Velden transfer</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	COACH DETAILS: MAN LION, 51+1 seats, reg.plate: PWT-290&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DRIVER:</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE:</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DATE: 2-8 September</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	COACH DETAILS:</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MEALS:&nbsp; 3 courses for local meals,&nbsp;</