(35001, 'TourPackage', 'TourPackage: add description service: <div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX: 20 PAX + 1 T/L + 1 Driver</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ROOM RQ: 8 TWIN + 1 TRP + 3 SGL</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	T/L: MS.SUNG CHIHSIEN&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE: +886 932339287; +44 7737306604&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER : <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Mr Temesi Laszlo<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE : +36 70 367 5371</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	COACH DETAILs: MAN, 49+2 seats, reg.plate: RDX-170</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** EETS will give budget to driver for 15 meals, please do not ask from T/L!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Driver and Local guide tips pay on spot by T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal online for visiting SALZBURG. In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility**</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting CESKY KRUMLOV. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting HALLSTATT. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div> at Cola #0221', 179, 'App\\TourPackage', 5, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"created\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/26\"}', '2023-11-15 03:22:28', '2023-11-15 03:22:28');
INSERT INTO `activity_log` (`id`, `log_name`, `description`, `subject_id`, `subject_type`, `causer_id`, `causer_type`, `properties`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(35002, 'TourPackage', 'change value of \'time_from\' from \'2024-02-22 12:00:00\' to \'2024-02-22 00:00\' at service: \'<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX: 20 PAX + 1 T/L + 1 Driver</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ROOM RQ: 8 TWIN + 1 TRP + 3 SGL</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	T/L: MS.SUNG CHIHSIEN&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE: +886 932339287; +44 7737306604&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER : <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Mr Temesi Laszlo<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE : +36 70 367 5371</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	COACH DETAILs: MAN, 49+2 seats, reg.plate: RDX-170</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** EETS will give budget to driver for 15 meals, please do not ask from T/L!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Driver and Local guide tips pay on spot by T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal online for visiting SALZBURG. In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility**</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting CESKY KRUMLOV. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting HALLSTATT. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time slot, the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div>\', at Tour: \'Cola #0221\'', 179, 'App\\TourPackage', 5, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"updated\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/26\"}', '2023-11-15 03:22:58', '2023-11-15 03:22:58'),
