(35313, 'Templates', 'change value of \'content\' from \'<p>\r\n	&lt;----- Place header content here -----&gt;<br />\r\n	&lt;----- Place content here -----&gt;<br />\r\n	&lt;----- Place footer content here -----&gt;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	This is a descritption Template for tms</p>\' to \'<p>\r\n	<u><strong>Itinerary front sheet</strong></u><u><strong>- TAIWAN</strong></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>PAX</strong><strong>** Clients, 1 Tour Leader, 1 Driver</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>ROOM RQ: &nbsp; </strong><strong>** </strong><strong>TWN</strong><strong>, ** </strong><strong>DBL</strong><strong>, ** </strong><strong>TRP</strong><strong>, ** </strong><strong>SGL</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;T/L: &nbsp;</strong><strong>** </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;MOBILE: &nbsp; </strong><strong>**</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;DRIVER: &nbsp;</strong><strong>M</strong><strong>r</strong>&nbsp; <strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;M</strong><strong>OBILE: </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;COACH DETAILS: </strong><strong>** seats,&nbsp; ** type</strong><strong>,&nbsp; </strong><strong>reg. plate</strong><strong>: **</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;MEALS:&nbsp; </strong><strong>3</strong>&nbsp;<strong>courses for local meals, 6 dishes</strong><strong>&amp; 1 </strong><strong>soup for Chinese meals</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>SPECIAL </strong><strong>MEAL </strong><strong>RQ:&nbsp; **</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>If meals not arranged or partly arranged by EETS &ndash; please choose one</strong></em></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>** </strong><strong>xx </strong><strong>Meals</strong><strong>are not arranged by EETS, T/L need to provide meal</strong><strong>or give budget</strong><strong>for driver</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>** </strong><strong>EETS arrange meal service for the group only </strong><strong>xx</strong><strong>times during the tour. Rest of the </strong><strong>meals </strong><strong>T/L need to provide meal</strong><strong>or </strong><strong>give&nbsp; budget</strong><strong>for driver</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>** EETS will give budget to driver for </strong><strong>meals,</strong><strong>please do not ask from T/L!</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**EETS arrange</strong><strong>s </strong><strong>m</strong><strong>eal service for the group only&nbsp;&nbsp; &hellip;</strong><strong>times during the </strong><strong>tour,m</strong><strong>eal</strong><strong>for driver is not included &hellip; </strong><strong>times-this is paid by EETS Rest of the meals T/L need to provide meal or give&nbsp; budget for driver</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>Please choose</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>one</strong></em></u><u><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></u><strong>**Driver and Local guide tips pay on spot by T/L</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Driver and Local guide tips paid by EETS</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>Please choose</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>one</strong></em></u><u><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></u><strong>**</strong><strong>Porterage</strong><strong>is included </strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**</strong><strong>Porterage</strong><strong>is NOT included</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>Please choose</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>one</strong></em></u><u><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></u><strong>**Highway fee pay on spot by Tour Leader</strong>&nbsp;<strong>xxx </strong><strong>Euro</strong><strong>. Driver can sign paper, </strong><strong>but he is unable to give any receipt.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Highway fee included</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>If group visits Salzburg need to add:</strong></em></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal online for visiting S</strong><strong>ALZBURG</strong><strong>. In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty on spot. For this group the time-slot i</strong><strong>s not arranged by EETS, it is the</strong><strong>T/L&#39;s responsibil</strong><strong>i</strong><strong>ty**</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>** SALZBURG</strong>&nbsp;<strong>pick-up/drop-off place and terminal</strong><strong>is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of </strong><strong>missing the booked time slot</strong><strong>,&nbsp; the</strong>&nbsp;<strong>penalty is paid by T/L on spot.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>If group visits </strong></em></u><u><em><strong>Hallstatt</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>need to add:</strong></em></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal online for visiting </strong><strong>HALLSTATT</strong><strong>. In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty on spot. For this group the time-slot i</strong><strong>s not arranged by EETS, it is the</strong><strong>T/L&#39;s responsibil</strong><strong>i</strong><strong>ty**</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>** HALLSTATT </strong><strong>pick-up/drop-off place and terminal</strong><strong>is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of </strong><strong>missing the booked time slot</strong><strong>,&nbsp; the</strong><strong>penalty is paid by T/L on spot.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>If group visits </strong></em></u><u><em><strong>Cesky</strong></em></u>&nbsp;<u><em><strong>Krumlov</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>need to add:</strong></em></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Every group has to book the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting </strong><strong>CESKY KRUMLOV</strong><strong>. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time </strong><strong>slot,</strong><strong>the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**</strong><strong>CESKY KRUMLOV </strong><strong>pick-up/drop-off place and terminal is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time </strong><strong>slot,</strong><strong>the penalty is paid by T/L on spot.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<u><em><strong>If group visits Dubrovnik need to add</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>one</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>:</strong></em></u></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**Dubrovnik city fee/check-point fee spot pay by T/L 110 Euro / 1 </strong><strong>pick up</strong><strong>and drop of</strong><strong>f.&nbsp; </strong><strong>Please check the details with your driver!</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**</strong><strong>Dubrovnik city fee/check-point fee included xx </strong><strong>times,</strong><strong>all other times </strong><strong>T/L </strong><strong>need to pay 110 Euro / 1 </strong><strong>pick up</strong><strong>and drop off.</strong><strong>Please check the details with your driver! </strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<em><strong>If </strong></em><em><strong>groups visits</strong></em><em><strong>Italy/France need to add:</strong></em></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>**City fees pay on spot by T/L / City fees paid by EETS in xx (cities)</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may </strong><strong>not &nbsp;exceed</strong><strong>9 hours.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive &nbsp;45 minutes or it can be </strong><strong>devided</strong><strong>to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>*For French domestic tours driver working hours:</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Minimum night rest is 12 hours</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Maximum working time is 12 hours</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach. </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;These are </strong><strong>at &nbsp;the</strong><strong>clients own risk.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>3.In</strong><strong>case you want to change a menu of &nbsp;restaurant please contact EETS at least </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;2 days before in order to ensure your request.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>4.In</strong><strong>case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>5.In</strong><strong>case of delay more than 30 </strong><strong>mins</strong><strong>to </strong><strong>itineray</strong><strong>please inform immediately </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>( e.g</strong><strong>. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>6.If</strong><strong>your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;responsible for possible penalty.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>7.If</strong><strong>meals not arrange by EETS, </strong><strong>Tourleader</strong><strong>need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</strong></p>\' at Templates \'Tour deleted\' in \'Cruise\' service', 29, 'App\\Templates', 5, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"updated\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/templates\\/29\"}', '2023-12-12 04:53:54', '2023-12-12 04:53:54'),
