(35371, 'TourPackage', 'TourPackage: add description service: <div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX :37PAX +1T/L+1Driver</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ROOM RQ: 13TWN+4DBL+1TRP+2SGL</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	T/L:MR.CHEN CHIENWEI&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE:+886-928-126-712</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER: L&eacute;ka Gyula<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE: +36 20 925 5270</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	Coach: SCANIA IRIZAR, seats: 51+2, registry: NCX-210</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MEALS:&nbsp; 3 courses for local meals, 7 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	SPECIAL MEAL RQ:&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3 PAX NO beef</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** Driver is included only on D6 and D7 lunch.&nbsp; EETS will give budget to driver for 12 meals, please do not ask from T/L!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Hallstatt parking fee 40 Euro pay on spot by T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** Salzburg city fee/parking fee 24 euro NOT included and arrange by T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div> at Cola Vie-Vie #0202', 260, 'App\\TourPackage', 5, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"created\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/32\"}', '2024-01-02 18:12:55', '2024-01-02 18:12:55'),
(35372, 'TourPackage', 'TourPackage: add description service: <div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ARRIVAL: VIENNA</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	FLIGHT:&nbsp; BR061&nbsp; TPE/VIE 22:30/08:25</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	VIENNA AIRPORT - TELC - PRG</div> at Cola Vie-Vie #0202', 261, 'App\\TourPackage', 5, 'App\\User', '{\"action\":\"created\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/dev.eetstravel.com\\/tour\\/32\"}', '2024-01-03 09:05:14', '2024-01-03 09:05:14'),
