 </strong><strong>slot,</strong><strong>the penalty is paid by T/L on spot. For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is the T/L&#39;s responsibility</strong></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>**</strong><strong>CESKY KRUMLOV </strong><strong>pick-up/drop-off place and terminal is booked by EETS for the requested date and time slot. It is T/Ls responsibility to control the timing, in case of missing the booked time </strong><strong>slot,</strong><strong>the penalty is paid by T/L on spot.</strong></p>\n<p>\n	&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n	<u><em><strong>If group visits Dubrovnik need to add</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>one</strong></em></u><u><em><strong>:</strong></em></u></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>**Dubrovnik city fee/check-point fee spot pay by T/L 110 Euro / 1 </strong><strong>pick up</strong><strong>and drop of</strong><strong>f.&nbsp; </strong><strong>Please check the details with your driver!</strong></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>or</strong></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>**</strong><strong>Dubrovnik city fee/check-point fee included xx </strong><strong>times,</strong><strong>all other times </strong><strong>T/L </strong><strong>need to pay 110 Euro / 1 </strong><strong>pick up</strong><strong>and drop off.</strong><strong>Please check the details with your driver! </strong></p>\n<p>\n	&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n	<em><strong>If </strong></em><em><strong>groups visits</strong></em><em><strong>Italy/France need to add:</strong></em></p>\n<p>\n	<strong>**City fees pay on spot by T/L / City fees paid by EETS in xx (cities)</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>\n	<strong><br />\n	&nbsp;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may </strong><strong>not &nbsp;exceed</strong><strong>9 hours.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive &nbsp;45 minutes or it can be </strong><strong>devided</strong><strong>to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</strong></p>\n<p>\n	&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n	<strong>*For French domestic tours driver working hours:</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Minimum night rest is 12 hours</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Maximum working time is 12 hours</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach. </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;These are </strong><strong>at &nbsp;the</strong><strong>clients own risk.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>3.In</strong><strong>case you want to change a menu of &nbsp;restaurant please contact EETS at least </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;2 days before in order to ensure your request.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>4.In</strong><strong>case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>5.In</strong><strong>case of delay more than 30 </strong><strong>mins</strong><strong>to </strong><strong>itineray</strong><strong>please inform immediately </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>( e.g</strong><strong>. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>6.If</strong><strong>your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;responsible for possible penalty.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong>7.If</strong><strong>meals not arrange by EETS, </strong><strong>Tourleader</strong><strong>need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;</strong><strong><br />\n	&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</strong></p>\' to \'<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	PAX:25PAX +1T/L+1Driver</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	ROOM RQ:11 TWN+1 DBL+3SGL&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	T/L: MR.TANG YUTO&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE:+886-932-023-598&nbsp; +44-741-846-4897</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DRIVER:&nbsp; &nbsp; M&aacute;k Tibor</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE: +36 70 639 7956</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	COACH:&nbsp; &nbsp;Setra 515 HD 49+2<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Reg Nr: NCC-088</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MEALS:&nbsp; 3 courses for local meals,&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	6 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	SPECIAL MEAL RQ:&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	1 PAX no lamb</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	In CKV Hotel Zlaty Andel, porterage requested, will be paid by T/L on spot</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Highway fee included</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	** Salzburg city fee/parking fee&nbsp; EUR 24.- not arranged by EETS</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Every group has to book online the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting Salzburg.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty 150 EUR on spot.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is at T/L&#39;s responsibilty**</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Hallstatt Parking fee will be paid on spot by the T/L&nbsp; (EUR 40.-)</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Refund request have to arrange by the T/L.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	EETS will give budget to the Driver for 11 meals.&nbsp; Pls do not ask meal or meal budget from the T/L</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!&nbsp;</div>\' at service: \'<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	PAX:25PAX +1T/L+1Driver</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	ROOM RQ:11 TWN+1 DBL+3SGL&nb