(5, 'Welcome EETS Family', 'Here is the section where we can write important NEWS. It is like the Forum we always wanted. I see a few people already online with pictures and everything. There is also a CHAT section below for instant information like WeChat!', 5, NULL, '2018-11-06 02:17:52', '2018-11-06 02:17:00', '2018-11-06 02:17:52'),
