0pt; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Julius</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">-----Original Message-----<br /> From: \"EETS-PRG-Grace\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:grace@eets.cz\">&lt;grace@eets.cz&gt;</a><br /> Sent: Friday, April 26, 2019 16:55<br /> To: \"Michael Ebert\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:michael.ebert@frankenland-travelgroup.de\">&lt;michael.ebert@frankenland-travelgroup.de&gt;</a><br /> Cc: \"EETS-BUD-DOROTHY\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:dorothy@eetstravel.com\">&lt;dorothy@eetstravel.com&gt;</a>, <a class=\"moz-txt-link-abbreviated\" href=\"mailto:jakarta@eetstravel.com\">jakarta@eetstravel.com</a>, <a class=\"moz-txt-link-abbreviated\" href=\"mailto:jakarta2@eetstravel.com\">jakarta2@eetstravel.com</a>, \"EETS-SEA-JULIUS\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:julius@eetstravel.com\">&lt;julius@eetstravel.com&gt;</a>, <a class=\"moz-txt-link-abbreviated\" href=\"mailto:indra@eetstravel.com\">indra@eetstravel.com</a>, \"EETS-VIE\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:vienna@eetstravel.com\">&lt;vienna@eetstravel.com&gt;</a>, \"EETS-BUD\" <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:budapest@eetstravel.com\">&lt;budapest@eetstravel.com&gt;</a><br /> Subject: Fw: itinerary - HT #0510 11D PRG-MUC<br /><br /></p>\n<div id=\"SafeStyles1556273156\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Arial\'; color: #000000;\">\n<div>Dear Michael,</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>12/03 booking size changed to 10 TWN + 1 SGL, however now comes the updated rooming list with 25pax (6 DBL + 2 TWN + 3 TRP), then plus 2 SGL for driver and T/L (they are not on the rooming list yet), please check with Duo if they could confirm the new booking size.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Dear Julis, Please send rooming in other version or you add T/L and driver on your PDF version.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>thanks,</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Grace</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: small; text-decoration: none; font-family: \'Calibri\'; font-weight: normal; color: #000000; font-style: normal; display: inline;\">\n<div style=\"font: 10pt                                                    tahoma;\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f5f5f5;\">\n<div style=\"font-color: black;\"><strong>From:</strong> <a title=\"julius@eetstravel.com\">julius@eetstravel.com</a></div>\n<div><strong>Sent:</strong> Friday, April 26, 2019 09:54</div>\n<div><strong>To:</strong> <a title=\"dorothy@eetstravel.com\">SzabÃ³ Dorottya - EETS Budapest</a></div>\n<div><strong>Cc:</strong> <a title=\"grace@eets.cz\">EETS-PRG-Grace</a> ; <a title=\"vienna@eetstravel.com\">EETS_Vienna</a> ; <a title=\"jakarta@eetstravel.com\">jakarta@eetstravel.com</a> ; <a title=\"indra@eetstravel.com\">Indra</a> ; <a title=\"jakarta2@eetstravel.com\">jakarta2@eetstravel.com</a> ; <a title=\"budapest@eetstravel.com\">\'EETS Budapest\'</a></div>\n<div><strong>Subject:</strong> Re: itinerary - HT #0510 11D PRG-MUC</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: small; text-decoration: none; font-family: \'Calibri\'; font-weight: normal; color: #000000; font-style: normal; display: inline;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Dear Dorothy &amp; Grace</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Warm regards from Jakarta</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Please kindly find the updated RL for this group, as attached (i will send the excel format soon).</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Also now the total no of pax is 25 (6 DBL + 2 TWN + 3 TRP + 2 SGL (TL &amp; Driver)) and as i know that we keep for 10 TWN + 1 SGL for now, so i need your kind help regarding the extra room ya.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Also i still push them regarding the additional service and extra km, will update you after i received info ya</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Best Regards</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Julius</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">-----Original Message-----<br /> From: <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:julius@eetstravel.com\">\"julius@eetstravel.com\"</a> <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:julius@eetstravel.com\">&lt;julius@eetstravel.com&gt;</a><br /> Sent: Tuesday, April 23, 2019 17:50<br /> To: \"SzabÃ³ Dorottya - EETS Budapest\"