 WINDERLICH\r\nReservation Agent\r\nARCOTEL Castellani Salzburg\r\n\r\nT +43 662 20 60 777\r\nF +43 662 20 60 666\r\nE gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com<mailto:gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com>\r\nwww.arcotelhotels.com<http://www.arcotelhotels.com/>\r\n\r\nData protection notice: We have a strong commitment to providing excellent service to all interested persons, customers and business partners. This includes the protection of your data. Information about the collection and processing of personal data is available in our data protection declaration<https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/about_website/data_protection/>.\r\n\r\n\r\n[AHH_GutscheinKampagne_Neutral_E_Mail_Signaturbanner_EN (002)]<https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/vouchers/?utm_source=footer&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=gutscheine_27_12_2018&utm_content=EN>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVon: BeÃ¡ta BartÃ³k (EETS Budapest) [mailto:beata@eetstravel.com]\r\nGesendet: Freitag, 03. Mai 2019 16:41\r\nAn: Gruppen Reservierung ARCOTEL Castellani <gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com>\r\nBetreff: Re: AW: New requests\r\n\r\nDear Roland,\r\n\r\nThank you for your prompt response.\r\nPlease hold the group on option till 08/May.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n\r\n[final.jpg]Beata Bartok (Ms)\r\nTour Operator\r\nEETS Budapest\r\nTel: +36 1 2019416 / Fax: +36 1 2019418\r\ne-mail: beata@eetstravel.com<mailto:daniel@eetstravel.com>\r\nskype: beata.eets\r\nwww.eetstravel.com<http://www.eetstravel.com>\r\nOn 2019.05.03. 16:31, Gruppen Reservierung ARCOTEL Castellani wrote:\r\nDear Beata,\r\n\r\nthank you very much for your requests.\r\nWe are pleased to offer Group #0613 at contracted rates and conditions.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately we are not able to offer the other requested groups, due to our booking situation.\r\n\r\nWith best regards\r\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\nROLAND LISKA\r\nRevenue Manager\r\nARCOTEL CASTELLANI SALZBURG\r\n\r\nT +43 662 20 60 612\r\nF +43 662 20 60 666\r\nE revenue.castellani@arcotelhotels.com<mailto:revenue.castellani@arcotelhotels.com>\r\nwww.arcotelhotels.com<http://www.arcotelhotels.com/>\r\n\r\n[AHH_GutscheinKampagne_Neutral_E_Mail_Signaturbanner_EN]<https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/vouchers/?utm_source=footer&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=gutscheine_27_12_2018&utm_content=EN>\r\n\r\n**********\r\nData protection notice: We have a strong commitment to providing excellent service to all interested persons, customers and business partners. This includes the protection of your data. Information about the collection and processing of personal data is available in our data protection declaration<https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/about_website/data_protection/>.\r\n\r\n**********\r\n\r\nVon: BeÃ¡ta BartÃ³k (EETS Budapest) [mailto:beata@eetstravel.com]\r\nGesendet: Freitag, 03. Mai 2019 11:38\r\nAn: Gruppen Reservierung ARCOTEL Castellani <gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com><mailto:gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com>\r\nBetreff: New requests\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDear Petra,\r\n\r\nHereby I send a new requests\r\n\r\nScits #0610 Waw-Vie - 17/June - 1 night - 13 twn + 1 sgl\r\nVISTA NJ #0613 Prg-Bud - 16/June - 17 twn + 2 sgl\r\nCtrip #0611 Vie-Vie - 12/June - 15 twn + 2sgl\r\n\r\nPlease send your offer including all t axes and breakfast with option till 11/May.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n--\r\n\r\n[final.jpg]Beata Bartok (Ms)\r\nTour Operator\r\nEETS Budapest\r\nTel: +36 1 2019416 / Fax: +36 1 2019418\r\ne-mail: beata@eetstravel.com<mailto:daniel@eetstravel.com>\r\nskype: beata.eets\r\nwww.eetstravel.com<http://www.eetstravel.com>\r\n\r\n', '<html xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\">\r\n<!--[if !mso]><style>v\\:* {behavior