ot;,sans-serif;color:#3333FF;mso-fareast-language:DE\"><a href=\"mailto:revenue.castellani@arcotelhotels.com\"><span style=\"color:#3333FF\">revenue.castellani@arcotelhotels.com</span></a></span></u><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#404040;mso-fareast-language:DE\"><a href=\"http://www.arcotelhotels.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.arcotelhotels.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/vouchers/?utm_source=footer&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=gutscheine_27_12_2018&amp;utm_content=EN\"><span style=\"color:windowtext;text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"533\" height=\"121\" style=\"width:5.552in;height:1.2604in\" id=\"Bild_x0020_1\" src=\"cid:image003.jpg@01D503F7.F8D2AEE0\" alt=\"AHH_GutscheinKampagne_Neutral_E_Mail_Signaturbanner_EN\"></span></a><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext\">**********</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext\">Data protection notice:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext\"> We have a strong commitment\r\n to providing excellent service to all interested persons, customers and business partners. This includes the protection of your data. Information about the collection and processing of personal data is available in our\r\n<a href=\"https://www.arcotelhotels.com/en/about_website/data_protection/\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">data protection declaration</span></a>.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext\">**********</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext;mso-fareast-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"color:windowtext\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"color:windowtext\"> BeÃ¡ta BartÃ³k (EETS Budapest) [<a href=\"mailto:beata@eetstravel.com\">mailto:beata@eetstravel.com</a>]\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Freitag, 03. Mai 2019 11:38<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> Gruppen Reservierung ARCOTEL Castellani <a href=\"mailto:gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com\">\r\n&lt;gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com&gt;</a><br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> New requests</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear Petra,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nHereby I send a new requests<br>\r\n<br>\r\nScits #0610 Waw-Vie - 17/June - 1 night - 13 twn &#43; 1 sgl<br>\r\nVISTA NJ #0613 Prg-Bud - 16/June - 17 twn &#43; 2 sgl<br>\r\nCtrip #0611 Vie-Vie - 12/June - 15 twn &#43; 2sgl<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease send your offer including all t axes and breakfast with option till 11/May.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThank you!<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">-- <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=\"_x0000_s1027\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" alt=\"final.jpg\" style=\'position:absolute;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;width:138pt;height:120pt;z-index:251659264;mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;mso-wrap-distance-top:0;mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;mso-position-horizontal:left;mso-position-horizontal-relative:text;mso-position-vertical-relative:line\' o:allowoverlap=\"f\">\r\n<v:imagedata src=\"cid:image002.png@01D503F7.F8D2AEE0\" o:title=\"part9.66F314D5.BDE3F7A8@eetstravel\" />\r\n<w:wrap type=\"square\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><![if !vml]><img width=\"184\" height=\"160\" style=\"width:1.9166in;height:1.6666in\" src=\"cid:image002.png@01D503F7.F8D2AEE0\" align=\"left\" hspace=\"12\" alt=\"final.jpg\" v:shapes=\"_x0000_s1027\"><![endif]><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Beata\r\n Bartok (Ms)</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Tour Operator</span> <br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">EETS Budapest</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Tel: &#43;36 1 2019416 / Fax: &#43;36 1 2019418</span> <br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">e-mail: beata<a href=\"mailto:daniel@eetstravel.com\">@eetstravel.com</a></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">skype: beata.eets<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.eetstravel.com\">www.eetstravel.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n', NULL, '2019-05-06 09:39:18', 'gruppen.castellani@arcotelhotels.com', NULL, '  <VI1P191MB01118595471F3B53873C5DFC8E300@VI1P191MB0111.EURP191.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>', 0, 133319, 'beata@eetstravel.com', 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, '2019-05-06 00:44:54', '2019-05-06 00:44:54', 1);
