moz-forward-container\"><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      -------- Forwarded Message --------\r\n      <table class=\"moz-email-headers-table\" cellspacing=\"0\"\r\n        cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n        <tbody>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"RIGHT\">Subject:\r\n            </th>\r\n            <td>Loisium problem for Cola Series</td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"RIGHT\">Date: </th>\r\n            <td>Wed, 24 Apr 2019 14:43:45 +0200</td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"RIGHT\">From: </th>\r\n            <td>Daniela Schwarz <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:daniela@eetstravel.com\">&lt;daniela@eetstravel.com&gt;</a></td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"RIGHT\">To: </th>\r\n            <td>\'John Wu\' <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:john@eetstravel.com\">&lt;john@eetstravel.com&gt;</a></td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n        </tbody>\r\n      </table>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html;\r\n        charset=windows-1252\">\r\n      <p>Dear John</p>\r\n      <p>I am writing in English in case you need to forward this.Â  <br>\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p>Loisium Beatrice called me this morning and they are rather\r\n        upset.Â  As you know they refused other business for the series,\r\n        but now they are getting worried since NOTHING CAME and already\r\n        8 GROUPS CANCELLED.Â  They are asking if we can release the\r\n        series so that they have a chance to sell further or take other\r\n        partners if nothing is going to come <br>\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p>I remember you mentioned Cola has those cookies? can you check\r\n        the situation for them ?Â Â  At least it would help if we can say\r\n        why nothing materialized till now , and if there are better\r\n        predictions for the next ones.Â Â Â  <br>\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p>I also asked if they got the bookings over another agent with\r\n        same or similar dates but it seem they did not.Â  Â Â  Â  Thanks.Â \r\n        Dani .</p>\r\n      <p><br>\r\n      </p>\r\n      <div class=\"moz-signature\">\r\n        <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;\r\n          charset=windows-1252\">\r\n        <meta name=\"ProgId\" content=\"Word.Document\">\r\n        <meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15\">\r\n        <meta name=\"Originator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15\">\r\n        <link rel=\"File-List\"\r\n          href=\"Daniela%20SCHWARZ%20Signatur_files/filelist.xml\">\r\n        <!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <o:DocumentProperties>\r\n  <o:Author>&#24373;&#21688;&#28147;</o:Author>\r\n  <o:Template>Normal</o:Template>\r\n  <o:LastAuthor>&#24373;&#21688;&#28147;</o:LastAuthor>\r\n  <o:Revision>2</o:Revision>\r\n  <o:TotalTime>4</o:TotalTime>\r\n  <o:Created>2017-02-07T08:31:00Z</o:Created>\r\n  <o:LastSaved>2017-02-07T08:31:00Z</o:LastSaved>\r\n  <o:Pages>1</o:Pages>\r\n  <o:Words>114</o:Words>\r\n  <o:Characters>655</o:Characters>\r\n  <o:Lines>5</o:Lines>\r\n  <o:Paragraphs>1</o:Paragraphs>\r\n  <o:CharactersWithSpaces>768</o:CharactersWithSpaces>\r\n  <o:Version>16.00</o:Version>\r\n </o:DocumentProperties>\r\n <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n  <o:AllowPNG/>\r\n </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n</xml><![endif]-->\r\n        <link rel=\"themeData\"\r\n          href=\"Daniela%20SCHWARZ%20Signatur_files/themedata.thmx\">\r\n        <link rel=\"colorSchemeMapping\"\r\n          href=\"Daniela%20SCHWARZ%20Signatur_files/colorschememapping.xml\">\r\n        <!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <w:WordDocument>\r\n  <w:DontDisplayPageBoundaries/>\r\n  <w:SpellingState>Clean</w:SpellingState>\r\n  <w:GrammarState>Clean</w:GrammarState>\r\n  <w:TrackMoves>false</w:TrackMoves>\r\n  <w:T