(180, 'Schlossverwaltung&Hellbrunn', 'Salzburg', NULL, NULL, 'N', 'AT', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Unknown country: A-5020      \\nAddress Row5:       \\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SAZHEL', NULL, NULL, '2015-03-17 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 09:41:14', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:42', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
(181, 'Koenigssee - St. Bartholomae roundtrip cruise', 'Seestrasse 55', NULL, NULL, 'D-83471     ', 'DE', '+49 8652 96 36 18', '+49 8652 96 36 74', NULL, 'Ms. Uschi Kleinert', '+49 8652 96 36 14', 'kleinert@seenschifffahrt.de', '\\n\\nGeneral information \\nOur services operate all year round in heated electric motorboats (except for Dec 24 and in icy \\nweather). The boats operate approx. every 15 minutes during the summer season (June to Sept). \\nEach boat can carry about 80 passengers. \\nThe lake KÃ¶nigssee is the top attraction in the region of the Berchtesgadener Land and it fascinates \\na half million visitors a year. You may sometimes have to wait for a time during busy peak periods (= \\nsummer holidays, weekends, public holidays). Also a nice day after a long period of rain often is a \\nday with numerous visitors. \\nIn the summer season our busiest times are between 10 am and 12.30 pm (on certain peak days \\neven later) for the outward journey and from around 2.30 pm for the return journey from St. \\nBartholomÃ¤. \\nThe crossing from KÃ¶nigssee to St. BartholomÃ¤ takes about 35 minutes (single way). You should \\ncalculate in around 30 minutes for a visit to the world-famous pilgrimage church in St. BartholomÃ¤. \\nTherefore your visit to the KÃ¶nigssee will last around 90 minutes. \\nNevertheless please calculate your stay at KÃ¶nigssee not to short. The experiences also \\ndemonstrate us, that many travel groups lost muchtime by using the restrooms in St. BartholomÃ¤ \\nbecause of the short of restrooms on board. \\nIf you travel with a group please remember always to register your group beforehand. By registering \\nyour group (20 persons and more) not later than 3 days before starting your boat trip you are \\nguaranteed a boat crossing to St. BartholomÃ¤ at your desired departure time and therefore avoid \\nunnecessary waiting times on the outward journey. \\nReservation: T: +49 8652 9636-14 ~ F: +49 8652 9636-10 ~ Mail: zentrale@seenschifffahrt.de\\nIn the event of a delay at your travel dayplease contact our dock manager on +49 8652 9636-96. \\nUnfortunately reservations canâ€™t be accepted for the return journey. If however your group plan to \\nreturn by no later than 2.30 pm you will probably avoid any waiting times in busy peak periods in St. \\nBartholomÃ¤. \\nThe jetties of the â€˜SeelÃ¤ndeâ€™ (departure) are approx. 5 to10 minutes away from the public car park \\n(there is also enough parking place for buses). ', NULL, NULL, '2006-06-12 00:00:00', 'SCOBAY', '2018-07-24 14:00:18', NULL, '2015-09-14 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 16:52:15', 'www.bayerische-seenschifffahrt.de', '2018-06-29 09:20:42', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
