(369, 'Krka National Park', NULL, NULL, NULL, '22001', 'HR', '+385 22 201 777', NULL, 'info@npk.hr', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Krka NP, for 2017.\\nTicket (I, II, III, XI, XII) - â‚¬ 3.50\\nTicket (IV, V, VI, IX, X) - â‚¬ 13.00\\nTicket (July, August) - 17.50 â‚¬\\n It will not be possible to reserve boat from Skradin - Skradinski buk or vice versa but remains the option of booking transport from Skradin - Skradinski buk OR vice versa.\\n\\nBooking transportation is required prior notification, will be charged extra, depending on the size of the group or the boat:\\n\\nBooking transport by ship \"Ne&#269;ven\" 134 pax capacity is 615 Euro for 1 h and transport in one direction (April, May, June, September, October) or 750 Euro (July and August)\\n\\nBooking transport by ship \"Guduca\" capacity of 60 pax is 270 Euro for 1 h and transport in one direction (April, May, June, September, October) or 340 Euro (July and August)\\n\\nGroups can use the boat from Skradin in both directions (except in winter) at no extra charge but on condition that they wait in line with all the other visitors.\\nArranged by local guide Ms Irena Kuac\\nEntrance at Skradin by ship, exit by walk at Lozovac', NULL, NULL, '2006-06-12 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 13:53:33', NULL, '2016-10-07 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 09:19:01', 'http://www.npkrka.hr/', '2018-06-29 09:20:43', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
