(391, 'Cruise Spitz to Duerstein', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '+43 1 588800', '+43 1 58880440', 'info@ddsg-blue-danube.at', 'Blue Danube Schiffahrt GmbH', NULL, NULL, 'Coach in Duernstein\\nthe danube station is right below the abbey in front of the ice cream shop. There is parking for buses, but it\'s 700m from our danube station (which is Nr 20), but very close to danube station Nr 21 (at the Kuenringerbad, a public swimming pool).\\nParking fees are from 15.03.-15.11. from 8:00-19:00 as following:\\n    up to 1 hour              â‚¬ 12\\n    up to 1,5 hours         â‚¬ 18\\n    up to 2 hours            â‚¬ 24\\n    up to 2,5 and more    â‚¬ 28\\nIf the bus is only dropping passengers off or picking them up, you don\'t have to pay a parking fee. (driveway not through the barriers, but straight ahead, parallel to danube station Nr 22, there is space to turn around)', NULL, NULL, '2006-06-14 00:00:00', NULL, '0.72', NULL, '2012-09-28 00:00:00', '0.686863425925926', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:43', '2018-07-19 07:21:58', '2018-07-19 07:21:58', NULL),
