(475, 'The Skocjan Caves', NULL, NULL, 410, '6215', 'SI', '+386 (0)5 70 82 110', '+386 (0)5 70 82 111', NULL, 'Mr. Edi Polh ', '+386 5 70 82 104 ', 'psj.info@psj.gov.si', 'Visit of Skocjan Caves- Classical part.\\nThe visit lasts been, 1 Hours 30 minutes and 2 Hours. Visitors walk for about 3 km, in the caves are cca 500 stairs (up and down not all toghether) The temperature is the cave system is 12C, pls wear proper shoes, because the path in the caves can be wet.\\n\\nDear Tourleaders !\\nThe Groups should be arrive at least 10-15 minutes before the starting time of the tour,to the Park information center.\\nIn case of rain, all visitors should have umbrellas, because they have to walk from the information center till the cave entrance distance 500 meters, on a path through the forrest.\\nIf the elevators doesn\'t work, all visitors walk out of the saystem. In that case, the visit is 25 minutes longer, and visitors  do additional 300 stairs up. (not all toghether)', NULL, NULL, '2006-06-14 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 16:55:30', NULL, '2013-10-14 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 13:41:30', 'http://www.park-skocjanske-jame.si', '2018-06-29 09:20:44', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
