(518, 'Trencin Castle', NULL, NULL, NULL, '91101', 'SK', '+421 915 966 635', NULL, 'hrad@muzeumtn.sk', 'Melich JÃ¡n', NULL, 'marketing@muzeumtn.sk', '2017:\\n\\nWe offer Tour A - without a guide (it includes the area of the lower castle:Barracks, Well of Love, Starving Tower,)\\n and the Tower in the upper castle with the main courtyard. You do not need to book this tour. \\nIt is available from 9 to 17:00. The price is 5 Euros/Adult.\\n There is a reduced price for pensioners and students.\\n\\nTour B is a guided tour. It lasts for about an hour or less. These tours are in Slovak and they start every hour \\nor if necessary, ever half an hour. (from 10 to 17:00) The price: 6 Euros/Adult.\\n\\nIf you want to book a guided Tour B in English,\\nthere should be at least 15 people in your group.\\n(It means that if there there are just 10 people in your group\\nyou have to pay for those remaining 5 ones too.)\\nThere is also a fee of 15 Euros for this tour. ', 'The castle is opened daily. \\nNovember - March: 9 am - 3,30 pm\\nApril and October: 9 am - 4,30 pm\\nMai - September: 9 am - 5,30 pm', NULL, '2007-07-11 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 10:51:03', NULL, '2017-09-16 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 14:13:16', 'http://www.muzeumtn.sk/en/about-the-castle/summer-tower.html?page_id=416', '2018-06-29 09:20:44', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
