(653, 'Hallein: Salt Mine Entrance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AT', '+43 6132 2002490', '+43 6245 85285 18', NULL, 'Ms Margarethe Brandner', '+43 6245 852 8511', 'hallein@salzwelten.at', 'please show up at cash desk 15 minutes before tour starts!\\n\\nopening houirs 2017/2018 winter\\n\\ndaily 0900am - 0500 pm\\n2017: until incl Sun 05th November\\n2018: from Sat 24 Mar - Sun 04November\\n\\ndaily 1000am - 03:00pm\\n2017: from Mon 06Nov - Sun 31Dec\\n2018: from Mon 01Jan - Sun 08 Jan\\nfrom Sat 27 Jan - Fri 23Mar\\n\\n2018: closed for revision from Monday 08 Jan - incl Fr 26Jan\\n\\nIf you need an earlier opening - on rq only pls - we can offer mostly 09:30 for you during winter season - but pls always rq with us before offering to your clients', 'Opening hours  2017/2018      - we are open every day - even sundays and public holidays\\n\\ndaily 0900am - 0500pm                                2017:  until Sun 05th November (incl)\\n       ', NULL, '2007-06-29 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 15:57:33', NULL, '2017-09-22 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 14:30:47', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:45', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
