(656, 'Hallstatt Salt Mine Entrance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AT', '+43 6132 200 2400', '+43 6132 2004400', 'info@salzwelten.at', 'Ms Carola Sulzbacher', NULL, NULL, 'Important information:\\nWe have reserved the time slot indicated for your trip on the Salzbergbahn funicular. When you arrive, please go to the salt mine register at the departure station for the funicular.\\n\\nAt the arrival station, there is a path to walk (about 20 minutes) to reach the Knappenhaus, where you will meet your guide for the salt mine tour. Please go immediately to the register at the Knappenhaus.\\n\\nPlease bear in mind that other guests may participate in the guided tour, up to a maximum of 70 people per tour. The tour lasts about 70 minutes, and if needed it can be performed in two different languages.\\n\\nThe total time required for the visit is about 3 hours.\\n\\nWe provide, free of charge: bus parking, panoramic elevator, \"Welterbeblick\" skywalk, a theme path and other exhibits.\\n\\nAttention: Admission to the mine is only permitted for children over four years of age. We recommend sturdy footwear and warm clothing.', 'closed till 25 April 2015!\\n\\n+43 6132 2002490 (CEO)', NULL, '2006-06-16 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 11:00:36', NULL, '2017-09-05 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 10:20:48', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:45', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
