(1133, 'Dominican Monastery', 'Sveti Dominika 4', 'Dubrovnik Old Town', 12, NULL, 'HR', '-457.192307692308', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'We inform you that the construction works are about to\\nstart these days; the works include the renovation of the interior of our monastery\\nchurch, and they are going to last for the greater part of time of the coming tourist\\nseason.\\nTherefore, we would like to inform you now that there is a great probability that\\ndue to the construction works tourist groups and individual tourists in this particular\\nperiod of time will not be able to visit the house of prayer, our church which is an\\nexceptionally valuable religious and cultural monument of the city of Dubrovnik.\\nAlso, we inform you that our Dominican museum and cloister will be open and\\nworking full-time for tourists.', NULL, NULL, '2009-12-08 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 09:22:32', NULL, '2017-03-02 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 13:36:13', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:48', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
