(1186, 'Eisriesenwelt Werfen', 'Getreidegasse 21', NULL, NULL, '5020', 'AT', '+43 662 842 69014', '+43 662 842 6908', 'info@eisriesenwelt.at', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'General Information: ++43/(0)6468/5248\\nManagement Cable Car: ++43/(0)664/4022481\\n\\nOpening times\\n\\nCaves and cable-car service: daily from 1. May to 26. October. Opening times : 9.00 - 15.30 (last guided tour) or 16.30 (last guided tour in July and August). Tours last 75 minutes.\\n\\nGetting There:\\n\\nBuses have been able to drive up to the parking area for a number of years now. The road up the mountain has a maximum incline of 21% and has been extensively improved and widened in recent years. The 5 kilometre section of road from Werfen has two lanes and there are ample free bus parking facilities.\\n\\nPreparations for your visit\\n\\nHeavy shoes and warm clothing are recommended. Even in summer the temperature is usually below freezing. Lamps are handed out at the entrance to the cave, and during the tour additional magnesium lighting highlights the ice sculptures to great effect.\\n\\nPhysical requirements:\\n\\nPlease note that a visit to the caves is not suitable for the physically handicapped or those with walking difficulties and heart conditions, since access to the cable car and going from the cable car to the caves involves a 20-minute walk and in the caves visitors have to climb 134 metres in altitude and 1,000 steps!', NULL, NULL, '2010-06-29 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 16:14:12', NULL, '2013-04-25 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 16:57:09', NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:48', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
