(1284, 'Royal Palace', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ROYAL PALACE -The Royal Palace was built between 1924 and 1929 with the private funds of His Majesty King Aleksandar I. The Royal Complex is located on the highest point of Dedinje Hill with an area over 135 hectares (333 acres). Today The Royal Palace is the home of His Royal Highness Crown Prince Alexander and his family.  The sightseeing tour to the Royal Compound lasts for 2 hours and includes sightseeing of the Royal complex and refreshment. \\nThe Museums are closed on Monday.', NULL, NULL, '2012-08-23 00:00:00', NULL, '0.698888888888889', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018-06-29 09:20:49', '2018-07-19 07:21:58', '2018-07-19 07:21:58', NULL),
