(1505, 'BMW Plant tour', 'Landshuter Str. 56', 'Gate 2', NULL, '84130', 'DE', '+49 89 382 15750', NULL, 'info@bmw-besucherwesen.de', 'Mr. Hochbaum', NULL, NULL, 'Filming and photographing.\\n\\nVisitors are not allowed to take pictures or make films. Cameras and mobile phones may not be used and can be placed in lockers. \\n\\nDuration and Distance.\\n\\nAs a rule, plant tours last for 2 to 2.5 hours and lead through different production and outside areas. The distance covered is up to 3.5 kilometers. We recommend weatherproof clothing (umbrellas when necessary) and comfortable shoes.\\n\\nStart of tour.\\n\\nPlease arrive 15 minutes before start of the guided tour at the meeting point, defined in the confirmation of your booking. Delays can only be made up to a certain extent, as the plant tour is linked with production cycles. Please inform our visitor centre as soon as possible in case of a delay. \\n\\nCatering.\\n\\nYou will receive a beverage during the tour. You are not allowed to bring along or consume other drinks or food. \\n', NULL, NULL, '2012-11-13 00:00:00', NULL, '2018-07-24 16:55:35', NULL, '2014-10-28 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 10:28:35', 'http://www.bmw-besuchen.com/en/index.html', '2018-06-29 09:20:50', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', '2023-07-12 10:33:19', NULL),
