(2581, 'BMW Museum', 'Am Olympiapark 2', NULL, 123, 'D-80809  ', '', '+49 (0) 89 125016001', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'infowelt@bmw-welt.com', 'It is only necessary to make a reservation in advance if you want to participate in a guided tour.\\n\\nThe entrance prices for the BMW Museum are:\\n\\n- individual visitors: â‚¬ 10.00\\n- Groups of 5 or more: â‚¬ 9.00\\n\\nIt is also possible to take a guided tour through the BMW Museum. You can make a reservation by phone under 0049 (0)89-1250 160 01. The tour takes 1 hour and 30 minutes.\\n\\nThe prices for the tour are:\\n- individual visitors: â‚¬ 12.00\\n- individual visitors at a reduced rate*: â‚¬ 9.00\\n- closed visitor groups (max. 20 people): â‚¬ 150.00\\n- closed visitor groups (max. 20 people) at a reduced rate*: â‚¬ 100.00\\n\\nThe opening hours of the BMW Museum are from Tuesday to Sunday and Holidays from 10:00 a.m. to 06:00 p.m.\\n\\nThe BMW Museum is closed on every Monday and on the 24th, 25th, 26th and the 31st of December as well as on January 1st.\\n\\n', '+49 089125016001', NULL, '2007-11-14 00:00:00', 'MUCBMW', '2018-07-24 10:45:17', NULL, '2017-03-02 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 10:41:36', 'www.bmw-museum.de', '2018-06-29 09:20:40', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', NULL),
