(2652, 'New Palace, King Ludwig II Museum, Monastery', NULL, NULL, NULL, '83209', NULL, '+ 49 8051 6887-0', '+ 49 8051 6887-99', 'sgvherrenchiemsee@bsv.bayern.de', 'Ms Karin Sostin', '+49 8051 6887 570', NULL, 'Please pick up your tickets along with the confirmation at cash desk #1, which is located right across from the pier on the island.\\nPick up your tickets 45 minutes before the start of the guided tour. If you do not, your reserved tour will be cancelled and you will have to wait for the next possible tour.\\n\\nThe tickets include the visit of the Ludwig-II-Museum and the museum in the monastry Augustiner Chorherrenstift\\nwith the two galleries \"Chiemseemaler\" und \"Julius Exter\" (not guided)\\nHorse Carriage can be paid only on spot - 3 Euro p.p.', '7 â‚¬ from 15 persons + 10 â‚¬ total reservation fee\\nthey accept credit card as payment from Budapest', NULL, '2007-07-31 00:00:00', 'HERSCH', '2018-07-24 15:18:15', NULL, '2012-04-20 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 06:01:54', 'www.herrenchiemsee.de', '2018-06-29 09:20:41', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', NULL),
