(2658, 'Innsbrucker Nordkettenbahnen GmbH&Co KG', 'Hoehenstrasse 145', NULL, NULL, 'A-6020      ', NULL, '+43 512 290520,+43 512 293344', '+43 512 29052013', 'sales@nordkette.com', 'Stefanie Geiger', '+43 512 293344 / Mob. +43 676 7024355', 's.geiger@nordkette.com', 'Opening time:\\nSection1: Hungerburgbahn 8:00-19:15 (MON-SUN)\\nSection2: Seegrubenbahn 8:30-17:30 (MON-SUN)  18:00-23:30 only on FRI!\\nSection3: Hafelekarbahn 9:00-17:00\\n\\nThe cable car depart evey 15min! \\n\\n!! VERY IMPORTANT NEWS !!\\n-They accept using our EETS Voucher!\\n-Bus groups with more than 20pax (without guide) can park free at the Hofgarten, driver will receive a refund voucher at the congress ticket counter for the bus parking fee of 30EURO!\\n-Every 20 people, the 21th get a free ticket!\\n\\nSection 1: actually this section can only reach by coach, so the bus can drive up to this station and take the section2 to the top\\n\\nRegular rate: 8,60EURO <<when make quote please use this price\\nOUR RATE: 6EURO \\n\\nSection 2 or Section 3 : Most of OUR groups will go till Section 2 only and not further because the restaurant is located at 2nd station. Of course you can go up further to Section 3 and it is the same price\\n\\nRegular rate: 33EURO <<when make quote please use this price\\nOUR RATE: 16,50EURO\\n\\nSection 2 or Section 3 incl 1xcup of coffee or tea+1 x cake\\n\\nRegular Rate: 40,50EURO <<when make quote please use this price\\nOUR RATE: 22,10EURO\\n\\nRestaurant offer:\\n2 course Menu for 11,50EURO\\n3 course Menu for 14,50EURO\\nCoffee&Cake for 5,6 EURO', 'sales@nordkette.com\\n\\nPlease use this email address !!!! \\n\\nIf the booked route starts in \"Innsbruck Station Congress\" the address is: Rennweg 3 (most of the groups will start from there)\\n', NULL, '2006-06-12 00:00:00', 'INNNOR', '2018-07-24 13:23:34', NULL, '2017-08-28 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 16:14:32', 'www.tirol.com/nordkette', '2018-06-29 09:20:41', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', '2023-07-12 10:59:06', NULL),
