(2824, 'Stift Melk Benediktinerkloster', 'Abt-Berthold-Dietmayr-Strasse ', NULL, NULL, 'A-3390      ', NULL, '+43 2752 555232', '+43 2752 555249', NULL, 'Ingrid Gramm, Angelika Ziegler', NULL, 'tours@stiftmelk.at', 'During the visit of Melk abbey our guests see the exhibition in the former Imperial Rooms, the Marble Hall, the balcony and the library. The end of the tour is the church which can only be visited without guide.\\nA tour takes approximately 1 hour.\\n\\nBetween May and October a visit (without guide) of the abbey park and its baroque garden pavilion is included in the entrance price. We recommend 30-45 minutes for the park visit.\\nThe visit of the newly restored northern bastion â€“ with a spacious gift shop, additional exhibition space and a panoramic terrace â€“ is also included in the entrance price. Recommended time for the bastion visit: 30 minutes', NULL, NULL, '2007-06-04 00:00:00', 'MELSTI', '2018-07-24 16:24:08', NULL, '2016-08-22 00:00:00', '2018-07-24 10:25:26', 'www.stiftmelk.at', '2018-06-29 09:20:41', '2018-07-23 20:22:04', NULL, NULL),
