(80, 'Hotel Goldenes Schiff ', 'Stifter-Kai 3', NULL, 0, 'A-4820      ', 'AT', '+43 6132 24241', '+43 6132 2424158', ' hotel@goldenes-schiff.at', 'Mr Edwin Gruber, Elisabeth', NULL, 'reservierung@goldenes-schiff.at', NULL, '1) We have a unique situation regarding our pedestrian zone which is divided onto two streets and the hotel is situated right between those two. The first is closed from 9:30 am until 6:30 pm and the second from 6:30 pm until 9:30 am. This makes it possible for your clients to arrive at our hotel at any time but they have to look out for the open/closed signs depending their arrival time.\\n\\n2) There are two bus stops near the hotel to let our guests off the bus and remove the luggage. These stops are not for parking and the driver will risk a fine or even a file charge for leaving the bus there. One of the stops is after 6:30 pm within a pedestrian zone and is not accessible until 9:30 am!\\n\\n3) The bus itself has to move to one of the two local bus parking areas. One is near the ï¿½Kaiservillaï¿½ and the second a little bit off the centre of Bad Ischl (about 1,5km). Enclosed there is a map of the town and I have marked the areas for you to hand over to the bus drivers. We have an arrangement with a local taompany for a free transfer from the bus parking areas to the hotel and back for the drivers.\\n\\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-02-27 07:23:47', '2024-02-27 07:23:47', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL),
