(197, NULL, '<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	PAX:&nbsp; 38 pax+1TL+1DRIVER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER:&nbsp; Robert Skledar&nbsp; &nbsp;( from Vienna until 12. Feb Dubrovnik Airport)</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MOBILE: +385 917 524 599</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	COACH: SETRA S 515 HD, year 2018, plate number ZG2601GO,&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	48+2+1 seater</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER 2&nbsp; &nbsp;( from 12. Feb Zagreb Airport until the end of the tour)</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	DRIVER: IVAN CULJAK</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	+385 981 836 140</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	coach: SETRA S 515 HD,&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	Reg Nr: ZG2602GO, 48+2+1ss, year 2018</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	ON THE COACH, CLIENTS WILL HAVE HAND DESINFACTION GEEL FREE ON CHARGE&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	MEALS:&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3 courses + coffee/tea for local lunch</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4 courses for local dinner</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	All meals include table water or 0,25 liter mineral water/pax</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	SPECIAL MEAL REQUESTS:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3 clients don&#39;t eat beef</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1 clients is vegetarian</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** One bottle of water (0,5l) per person per day will be arranged by driver, pay on spot by T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Driver and local guide tips will be paid on spot by the T/L</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** Highway fee included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** Porterage service not included</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**Dubrovnik city fee/check-point fee included 1 times, all other times T/L need to pay 110 Euro / 1 pick up and drop off. Please check the details with your driver!&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	** Split city fee pay on spot by driver 1 times. all other times T/L need to pay 2 x 300 KUNA ( one pick up + one drop off)</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3 Hours free parking is possible during the Winter season ( until 31 March) for this price</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	**2 Meals are not arranged by EETS. EETS will give meal budget to the Driver for 2 meals. Pls do not ask meal or meal budget from the T/L!</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!</div>', 9, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, '2023-11-23 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-11-16 13:27:59', '2023-11-16 12:01:55', '2023-11-16 13:27:59', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0),
