(301, NULL, '<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	PAX:25PAX +1T/L+1Driver</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	ROOM RQ:11 TWN+1 DBL+3SGL&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	T/L: MR.TANG YUTO&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE:+886-932-023-598&nbsp; +44-741-846-4897</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	DRIVER:&nbsp; &nbsp; M&aacute;k Tibor</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MOBILE: +36 70 639 7956</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	COACH:&nbsp; &nbsp;Setra 515 HD 49+2<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Reg Nr: NCC-088</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	MEALS:&nbsp; 3 courses for local meals,&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	6 dishes &amp; 1 soup for Chinese meals</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	SPECIAL MEAL RQ:&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	1 PAX no lamb</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Porterage is NOT included</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	In CKV Hotel Zlaty Andel, porterage requested, will be paid by T/L on spot</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Highway fee included</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	** Salzburg city fee/parking fee&nbsp; EUR 24.- not arranged by EETS</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	**Every group has to book online the pick-up/drop-off place and terminal for visiting Salzburg.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	In case the T/L has no valid QR code for the booked time-slot, T/L has to pay the penalty 150 EUR on spot.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	For this group the time-slot is not arranged by EETS, it is at T/L&#39;s responsibilty**</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Hallstatt Parking fee will be paid on spot by the T/L&nbsp; (EUR 40.-)</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	Refund request have to arrange by the T/L.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	EETS will give budget to the Driver for 11 meals.&nbsp; Pls do not ask meal or meal budget from the T/L</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR TOUR LEADER</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	1.There are EC Regulations (561/2006EC and 22/2006EC) for LDC Drivers to ensure your safety on the road:</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Daily (24h) driving time for a driver may not&nbsp; exceed 9 hours.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Driving time can extend to 10 hours only 2 times per week.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Daily rest time for driver must have at least 11 consecutive hours.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	* Rest time after 4,5 hours driving must be consecutive&nbsp; 45 minutes or it can be devided to one stop with 15 minutes and second stop with 30 minutes consecutive rest time.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2.We are not responsible for any clients belongings left on board the coach.&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	These are at&nbsp; the clients own risk.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	3.In case you want to change a menu of&nbsp; restaurant please contact EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2 days before in order to ensure your request.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	4.In case you want to cancel a restaurant you are requested to inform EETS at least&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	2 days before to avoid possible charge by the restaurant.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	5.In case of delay more than 30 mins to itineray please inform immediately&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	restaurant / hotel / attraction or EETS in order to avoid possible problems .</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	( e.g. if too late check in hotel without inform the hotel ,can be no porter service )</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	6.If your coach is equipped with seat-belt on every seat, please ask client to fasten the&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	seat-belt during the journey for their own safety. In case of police control you are&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	responsible for possible penalty.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	7.If meals not arrange by EETS, Tourleader need to provide meals for guides and drivers. If this is not the case EETS will charge it to Agent after the tour.</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\">\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; THANKS FOR YOUR COOPERATION AND UNDERSTANDING!!&nbsp;</div>', 9, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-02-01 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-01-08 13:32:59', '2024-01-08 13:34:24', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0),
(302, NULL, '<p>\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 102); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(243, 245, 249);\">ARRIVAL DAY: BUDAPEST</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 102); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(243, 245, 249);\" />\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 102); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(243, 245, 249);\">FLIGHT: EK111 DXB/BUD &nbsp;08:40 / 11:45</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 102); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(243, 245, 249);\" />\n	&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n	<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(243, 245, 249); color: rgb(0, 51, 102); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;\">BUDAPEST AIRPORT - BUDAPEST</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', 9, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-02-02 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-01-08 13:35:00', '2024-01-08 16:07:43', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0),
